  {
   "id": "ender-magnolia-bloom-in-the-mist-287846@1.0.3",
   "gameId": "ender-magnolia-bloom-in-the-mist-287846",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-01-27T07:25:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We just released the version 1.0.3,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "a small update containing mostly bug fixes and balance adjustments.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch notes: 1.0.3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Adjustments",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Enemies parameter adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Reinforced Lab Rat: lower attack, stamina and resistance to status effects",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Experimental Manufacturer (Rat generator): lower HP",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Combat Puppet: No. 20, 14, 56 (\"Arena Tower\" mini bosses): lower HP to increase tempo of the battle sequence",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Combat Puppet: No. 7 (\"Arena Tower\" boss): lower the power of some attacks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Other small adjustments on various enemies",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add platforms in the \"Crimson Forest\" area to allow for better shortcuts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Add visual representation of the general teleportation direction on warp points for easier navigation",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lower the effectiveness of some skills of \"Lorna\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Brush up of some background visuals",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bug fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fix the map completion that was not rendered properly on some GPU*",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the area \"Land of origin\", concerning a specific growth:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix the visibility state that would sometimes stay invisible",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "change the geometry of the level to make the growth easier to break, especially on low FPS machines",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix the BGM of the boss in the \"Magicite Mine\" area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Parry actions:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix player collision size after parry actions that could stay bigger than normal for a few frames",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fix parry actions that were not resetting airborne action count correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Translations and texts fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various small behaviour, visual and animation fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue to make fixes and improvements to make ENDER MAGNOLIA an enjoyable experience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "* While we believe the bug is fixed, we couldn't test many GPU yet.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "If the bug is still present in the latest version, please try to launch the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "using either \"-dx11\" or \"-vulkan\" as a launch option through Steam",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "while we work on fixing it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
