   "announcedAt": "2024-03-29T03:47:56.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The team is currently working hard on the development of the game to make sure it meets your expectations.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are updating the game to 0.5.1 with a focus on bug fixes,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and we would like to use this opportunity to address the main topics of discussion we see coming often:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding the areas that are currently playable in the early version of the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "At the time of the full release, we plan to expand on those area a bit by adding more discoverable items and changing the terrain.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We will continue to brush up those areas to make exploration more engaging.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding the game's difficulty",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are aiming for a more linear difficulty, with the difficulty ramping up progressively through the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The future areas should offer more challenging battles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you are worried about the difficulty, we plan to have different difficulty settings that can be changed at any time to your liking.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Regarding cutscenes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are aware of the subtitles displaying too fast in most language, and are planing to correct this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Updates in version 0.5.1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
